      "jp": "アミラミさんはすごいですね……。\nこんなに薄暗い場所なのに、\n小さな明かりだけで怖くないんですか？",
      "jp_sha256": "bd4e0f7c0dbeba3f6293497ae9a878eff047d8d7d107a1bb7deb942afcd814c8",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아미라미 씨는 대단하시네요…….\n이렇게 어두운 곳인데\n작은 불빛만으로도 무섭지 않으세요?",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b002-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "a8bd7fb3a3f7ab817d7433caf3f900c0f8b0c5d0b6fdebb8aa4c439b89fac251:000000_-4202332967454189919:g0:r10",
